  "title": "Centene Supports Equitable Cancer Care at NMQF Summit",
  "description": "Centene is focused on improving access to cancer care in under-resourced communities. Dr. William Lawrence, Chief Medical Officer of Centene subsidiary Carolina Complete Health recently spoke about Centene’s work at National Minority Quality Forum’s Cancer Care Equity Summit at the Association of American Medical Colleges. ",
